cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Mapping present and future forest fire susceptibility in Guatemala: machine learning projections to 2100"
version: 1.0.0
# date-released: YYYY-MM-DD          # fill in when the release is tagged
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX        # fill in after the first Zenodo release
abstract: >-
  Code of the paper "Mapping present and future forest fire susceptibility in Guatemala:
  machine learning projections to 2100". It trains machine-learning classifiers on monthly
  forest-fire records of Guatemala and the climate of nine global climate models
  (CHELSA-downscaled ISIMIP3b), maps the fire susceptibility of every 30 arc-second land
  cell of the country in five equal-area classes, and projects it from 1961 to 2100 under
  SSP1-2.6, SSP3-7.0 and SSP5-8.5.
authors:
